{"id":"1e3f4af7bf60a629","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-lem-product.md","title":"Product Lemma","display":"lem-product — Product Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-lem-product","aliases":["58-lem-product"],"display":"lem-product — Product Lemma","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-ctm.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-generic.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-lem-product"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-lem-product</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-product — Product Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"66d43bb76d055059\" href=\"?note=66d43bb76d055059\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-ctm.md\">../batch06/58-df-ctm.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"545853811ce0a4b6\" href=\"?note=545853811ce0a4b6\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-generic.md\">../batch16/58-df-generic.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0c40d420e5118724\" href=\"?note=0c40d420e5118724\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md\">../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\Gamma,N_G,N_K,G,H,K,P,Q,\\le_P,\\le_Q,\\le_{P\\times Q}\\in V\">\\(M,\\Gamma,N_G,N_K,G,H,K,P,Q,\\le_P,\\le_Q,\\le_{P\\times Q}\\in V\\)</span>, where <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> is the ground theory</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(P,\\le_P),(Q,\\le_Q)\\in M\">\\((P,\\le_P),(Q,\\le_Q)\\in M\\)</span> (forcing posets, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(p,q)\\le_{P\\times Q}(p&#39;,q&#39;)\\leftrightarrow p\\le_Pp&#39;\\land q\\le_Qq&#39;\">\\((p,q)\\le_{P\\times Q}(p&#39;,q&#39;)\\leftrightarrow p\\le_Pp&#39;\\land q\\le_Qq&#39;\\)</span> (product order)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CTM}_S,\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{CTM}_S,\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (ground-model and poset predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Generic}:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Generic}:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (model-relative generic-filter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"545853811ce0a4b6\" href=\"?note=545853811ce0a4b6\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-generic.md\">../batch16/58-df-generic.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> is the valuation predicate</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExtensionSet}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ExtensionSet}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> is the set-coded extension relation defined here</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}product\\text{-}extension\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ExtensionSet}_S(N,M,P,G)\n\\leftrightarrow\nN=\\{x\\in V:\\exists\\tau\\in M\\;\n\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S(x,\\tau,G,P)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}product\\text{-}extension\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ExtensionSet}_S(N,M,P,G)\n\\leftrightarrow\nN=\\{x\\in V:\\exists\\tau\\in M\\;\n\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S(x,\\tau,G,P)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}product}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\n\\land P,\\le_P,Q,\\le_Q\\in M\n\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\le_P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(Q,\\le_Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\le_{P\\times Q}=\\Bigl\\{\n\\langle\\langle p,q\\rangle,\\langle p&#39;,q&#39;\\rangle\\rangle\\in(P\\times Q)^2:\n\\langle p,p&#39;\\rangle\\in\\le_P\\land\\langle q,q&#39;\\rangle\\in\\le_Q\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Generic}(K,P\\times Q,\\le_{P\\times Q},M)\\\\\n{}\\to{}&amp;\n\\exists G,H,N_G,N_K\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nG=\\{p\\in P:\\exists q\\in Q\\;(\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in K)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land H=\\{q\\in Q:\\exists p\\in P\\;(\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in K)\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Generic}(G,P,\\le_P,M)\n\\land\\mathrm{ExtensionSet}_S(N_G,M,P,G)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Generic}(H,Q,\\le_Q,N_G)\n\\land\\mathrm{ExtensionSet}_S(N_K,N_G,Q,H)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{ExtensionSet}_S(N_K,M,P\\times Q,K)\n\\land K=G\\times H\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}product}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\n\\land P,\\le_P,Q,\\le_Q\\in M\n\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\le_P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(Q,\\le_Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\le_{P\\times Q}=\\Bigl\\{\n\\langle\\langle p,q\\rangle,\\langle p&#39;,q&#39;\\rangle\\rangle\\in(P\\times Q)^2:\n\\langle p,p&#39;\\rangle\\in\\le_P\\land\\langle q,q&#39;\\rangle\\in\\le_Q\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Generic}(K,P\\times Q,\\le_{P\\times Q},M)\\\\\n{}\\to{}&amp;\n\\exists G,H,N_G,N_K\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nG=\\{p\\in P:\\exists q\\in Q\\;(\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in K)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land H=\\{q\\in Q:\\exists p\\in P\\;(\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in K)\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Generic}(G,P,\\le_P,M)\n\\land\\mathrm{ExtensionSet}_S(N_G,M,P,G)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Generic}(H,Q,\\le_Q,N_G)\n\\land\\mathrm{ExtensionSet}_S(N_K,N_G,Q,H)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{ExtensionSet}_S(N_K,M,P\\times Q,K)\n\\land K=G\\times H\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>No chain-condition hypothesis is needed for the product lemma.</li>\n<li>The witness <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_G\">\\(N_G\\)</span> is the set previously denoted informally by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M[G]\">\\(M[G]\\)</span>; the same <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_K\">\\(N_K\\)</span> is obtained from the product extension and the two-step extension, so no bracket notation is left semantically unbound.</li>\n<li>This is the constant-name special case of the general two-step iteration theorem.</li>\n<li>The two projected filters are bound witnesses in the conclusion and are defined from the same product generic <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>; they are no longer free symbols supplied only by prose.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-ctm.md","status":"resolved","id":"66d43bb76d055059","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-ctm.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-generic.md","status":"resolved","id":"545853811ce0a4b6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-generic.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md","status":"resolved","id":"0c40d420e5118724","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(P,\\le_P),(Q,\\le_Q)\\in M$ (forcing posets, see [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-generic.md","status":"resolved","id":"545853811ce0a4b6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Generic}:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (model-relative generic-filter predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-generic.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,\\Gamma,N_G,N_K,G,H,K,P,Q,\\le_P,\\le_Q,\\le_{P\\times Q}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"(P,\\le_P),(Q,\\le_Q)\\in M","display":false},{"tex":"(p,q)\\le_{P\\times Q}(p',q')\\leftrightarrow p\\le_Pp'\\land q\\le_Qq'","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CTM}_S,\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Generic}:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ExtensionSet}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}product\\text{-}extension\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ExtensionSet}_S(N,M,P,G)\n\\leftrightarrow\nN=\\{x\\in V:\\exists\\tau\\in M\\;\n\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S(x,\\tau,G,P)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}product}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\n\\land P,\\le_P,Q,\\le_Q\\in M\n\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\le_P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(Q,\\le_Q)\\\\\n&\\land\\le_{P\\times Q}=\\Bigl\\{\n\\langle\\langle p,q\\rangle,\\langle p',q'\\rangle\\rangle\\in(P\\times Q)^2:\n\\langle p,p'\\rangle\\in\\le_P\\land\\langle q,q'\\rangle\\in\\le_Q\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Generic}(K,P\\times Q,\\le_{P\\times Q},M)\\\\\n{}\\to{}&\n\\exists G,H,N_G,N_K\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nG=\\{p\\in P:\\exists q\\in Q\\;(\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in K)\\}\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land H=\\{q\\in Q:\\exists p\\in P\\;(\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in K)\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Generic}(G,P,\\le_P,M)\n\\land\\mathrm{ExtensionSet}_S(N_G,M,P,G)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Generic}(H,Q,\\le_Q,N_G)\n\\land\\mathrm{ExtensionSet}_S(N_K,N_G,Q,H)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{ExtensionSet}_S(N_K,M,P\\times Q,K)\n\\land K=G\\times H\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"N_G","display":false},{"tex":"M[G]","display":false},{"tex":"N_K","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false}],"bytes":2597,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3917","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-lem-product.md|58-lem-product]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["66d43bb76d055059","545853811ce0a4b6","d3f859dbdd37f018","0c40d420e5118724"]}